: 386672, "username": "qwqqwq", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/qwqqwq", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/133a/2a74/386672_mini.png?m=1755242220", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/133a/2a74/386672_normal.png?m=1755242220", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/133a/2a74/386672_large.png?m=1755242220", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/133a/2a74/386672_xlarge.png?m=1755242220", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/133a/2a74/386672_xxlarge.png?m=1755242220", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/133a/2a74/386672_xxxlarge.png?m=1755242220", "created": 1551011548, "last_modified": 1755242220, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "laminux29", "last_touched": 1789806894, "title": "工资越高是不是工作越轻松", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1243077", "created": 1789741843, "deleted": 0, "content": "月薪 4-5W 的应该比 1-2W 的轻松点吧，基本就是开开会啥的，这种基本都是管理领导之类的\n\n1-2W 的干的活应该是最多的，体力和脑力的那种，不知道制造业是不是挺多这种的\n\n互联网体力工作应该很少，主要是脑力劳动和沟通占的多吧\n\n还是管理和领导舒服啊，工资高还不累", "content_rendered": "<p>月薪 4-5W 的应该比 1-2W 的轻松点吧，基本就是开开会啥的，这种基本都是管理领导之类的</p>\n<p>1-2W 的干的活应该是最多的，体力和脑力的那种，不知道制造业是不是挺多这种的</p>\n<p>互联网体力工作应该很少，主要是脑力劳动和沟通占的多吧</p>\n<p>还是管理和领导舒服啊，工资高还不累</p>\n", "last_modified": 1789779023, "replies": 40, "id": 1243077}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "/static/img/node_default_large.png", "name": "solodeveloper", "avatar_normal": "/static/img/node_default_normal.png", "title": "独立开发", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/solodeveloper", "topics": 1, "footer": "", "header": "", "title_alternative": "独立开发", "avatar_mini": "/static/img/node_default_mini.png", "stars": 1, "founder_id": 789455, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1376, "parent_node_name": null}, "member": {"id": 651160, "username": "EricYuan1", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/EricYuan1", "website": "https://launch-x-website.vercel.app", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b331/dc8e/651160_mini.png?m=1786883813", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b331/dc8e/651160_normal.png?m=1786883813", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b331/dc8e/651160_large.png?m=1786883813", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b331/dc8e/651160_xlarge.png?m=1786883813", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b331/dc8e/651160_xxlarge.png?m=1786883813", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b331/dc8e/651160_xxxlarge.png?m=1786883813", "created": 1695729715, "last_modified": 1786883813, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "GyroZeppeli13", "last_touched": 1789807380, "title": "看图，好像确实是这样子", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1243104", "created": 1789780666, "deleted": 0, "content": "自从 AI 出来后，包括我自己，也是兴致冲冲的开发了 [Launchx 来](<https://github.com/twotwoba/LaunchX>)自用，好像是个人都能指挥 AI 开发出自己的产品。\n\n![]( https://i.imgur.com/bvnsux6.jpeg)\n\n我不否认，AI 在企业级项目上还不能做到很完美，但是工具类的东西，几乎没有不能完成的。\n\n就说 V2EX 的 ios 客户端吧，v 站上就看到了很多个，挨个用下来过，现在我个人感觉最好用的就是 Vex （非广告，我是早期用户），它让我感觉好的设计与用户体验也许能让产品存活下来。\n\n但是，我又思考了一个问题：设计与用户体验是 AI 最容易复刻的！如何才能保证产品的竞争力呢？\n\n独立开发者要怎么做才能在这个 AI 时代立足呢？", "content_rendered": "<p>自从 AI 出来后，包括我自己，也是兴致冲冲的开发了 <a href=\"https://github.com/twotwoba/LaunchX\" rel=\"nofollow\">Launchx 来</a>自用，好像是个人都能指挥 AI 开发出自己的产品。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bvnsux6.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p>我不否认，AI 在企业级项目上还不能做到很完美，但是工具类的东西，几乎没有不能完成的。</p>\n<p>就说 V2EX 的 ios 客户端吧，v 站上就看到了很多个，挨个用下来过，现在我个人感觉最好用的就是 Vex （非广告，我是早期用户），它让我感觉好的设计与用户体验也许能让产品存活下来。</p>\n<p>但是，我又思考了一个问题：设计与用户体验是 AI 最容易复刻的！如何才能保证产品的竞争力呢？</p>\n<p>独立开发者要怎么做才能在这个 AI 时代立足呢？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1789780666, "replies": 29, "id": 1243104}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/1fc2/1400/864_large.png?m=1778522847", "name": "promotions", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/1fc2/1400/864_normal.png?m=1778522847", "title":