ered": "<p>复杂任务 AI 动不动执行要 1~2 个小时，人不可能一直坐在电脑旁等结果，有没比较好的方案能让 AI 实现 24 小时自动化开发，并且可以设定哪个 AI 负责验收和补充，哪个 AI 负责开发。以及 5 个小时额度耗尽，会自动等 5 小时额度恢复继续执行任务？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1789802235, "replies": 17, "id": 1243154}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 241711, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4518, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 4334, "username": "yibin001", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/yibin001", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "ShangHai", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/da6c/b383/4334_mini.png?m=1782477776", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/da6c/b383/4334_normal.png?m=1782477776", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/da6c/b383/4334_large.png?m=1782477776", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/da6c/b383/4334_xlarge.png?m=1782477776", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/da6c/b383/4334_xxlarge.png?m=1782477776", "created": 1293368754, "last_modified": 1782477776, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "Yishanshan", "last_touched": 1789754518, "title": "iPhone ➕联通真的等于失联吗", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1243053", "created": 1789729346, "deleted": 0, "content": "之前用 17e 港版就是因为苹果的自研基带，结果发现我的联通卡从无信号地带回到有信号区域时不会重连，必须开关飞行。\r\n\r\n现在 18 pro 也是这个基带，也不能主动搜信号了。\r\n\r\n不知道你们的 18➕联通是不是也这样", "content_rendered": "之前用 17e 港版就是因为苹果的自研基带，结果发现我的联通卡从无信号地带回到有信号区域时不会重连，必须开关飞行。<br /><br />现在 18 pro 也是这个基带，也不能主动搜信号了。<br /><br />不知道你们的 18➕联通是不是也这样", "last_modified": 1789729346, "replies": 16, "id": 1243053}, {"node": {"avatar_large